   "stem_html": "<p dir=\"ltr\">How does the graph of <span data-math=\"f(x)=\\frac14 x -3\">f(x)=\\frac14 x -3</span> change from the parent function, <span data-math=\"f(x)=x\">f(x)=x</span>?<br></p>",
